 "discovery_notes": "Cell B427, follow-up 24 of B041 (reuses 397/445/478/505/526/546/564/575/584/592/600/607). 28 standard searches; all claims from search summaries. New: HKDL Zootopia 5th Anniversary LE 600 pin (Mar 2021); SHDR Avengers Mini Set 2020 (six per-pin My Pin Central entries, LE 500; possibly same release as the DPB Marvel Emblems set - field note, not merged); TDR Totally Minnie Mouse random pin (Feb 2022, six costume designs held). Re-used: TDR Toy Story 4 six-pin set (Jalan confirms 21 Apr 2021, JPY 2,900; members stay held), TS4 mystery (Jalan: 6 designs vs DPB 12), park-logo set date. No holds released; HKDL Jan 2022 / Jan 2023 untouched. Resellers seen, not used: usshoppingsos, castleplanethk, fryguypins, goodsrepublic."
}